# MagicSquare Project Rule

## Scope
- This project targets Python `3.10+`.
- Domain focus is magic square generation and validation.

## Quality Priorities
- Correctness over premature optimization.
- Tests-first delivery with explicit RED -> GREEN -> REFACTOR flow.
- Maintainability via clear ECB layer boundaries.

## Non-Negotiables
- Do not weaken tests to pass CI.
- Do not bypass TDD gates.
- Preserve behavior when refactoring.
